(1, 'This is a test message. Your {form_request} request has been received successfully. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: BBL UAT Team.', 'This is a test message. Your {form_request} complaint has been received successfully. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: BBL UAT Team.', 'This is a test message.\r\nYour {form_request} request has been received successfully. Ticket No {reference_no}. Query: 16221. Thank you for staying with BRAC Bank.\r\nRegards,\r\nBBL UAT Team', 'This is a test message.. \r\nYour {form_request} complaint has been received successfully. Ticket No {reference_no}. Thank you for informing us. \r\nRegards,\r\nBBL UAT Team', 'This is a test message.\r\nYour {form_request} request has been resolved successfully. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: BBL UAT Team.', 'This is test message.  Your {form_request} complaint has been solved. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: BBL UAT Team.', 'This is a test message.\r\nYour {form_request} request has been resolved successfully. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: BBL UAT Team. \r\nRegards,\r\nBBL UAT Team', 'This is a test message.\r\nYour {form_request} complaint has been solved. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: BBL UAT Team.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nBBL UAT Team', 'Use OTP: {otp_code} to proceed with service/complaint lodgement. This OTP will be valid for 3 minutes. Please do not shareÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡', 'Dear Customer,\r\n \r\nYour OTP is {otp_code} to proceed with your current Internet Banking activity and will be valid for next 3 minutes. For security, please do not share this with anyone. \r\n\r\nFor queries: call 16221 (Local); +880255668055, +880255668056, +8809611223344 (Overseas).\r\n\r\nSincerely, \r\nUAT-BRACÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â BankÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â Limited', 'This is a test message. Your service Ticket No {reference_no} is being processed. \r\nSend Back Reason is {Send_back_reason}\r\nThank you for your assistance in resolving the issue. Query: BBL UAT Team.', 'This is a test message.\r\nYour service Ticket No {reference_no} is being processed. Thank you for your assistance to resolve the issue {form_request}. \r\nSend Back Reason is {Send_back_reason}\r\nQuery: BBL UAT Team.\r\nThank you for staying with BRAC Bank.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nBBL UAT Team', 'This is a test message. Your service Ticket No {reference_no} is being processed. Thank you for your assistance to resolve the issue. Query: BBL UAT Team.', 'This is a test message. Your service Ticket No {reference_no} is being processed. Thank you for your assistance to resolve the issue {form_request}. Query: BBL UAT Team. Thank you for staying with BRAC Bank.  Regards, BBL UAT Team', '', '', 'This is a test message. We would like to communicate with you to resolve your {reference_no} issue of {form_request}. Query: BBL UAT Team.', 'This is a test message.\r\nThank you for calling us. We would like to communicate with you to resolve your {reference_no} issue of   {form_request}. Query: 16221. Thank you for staying with BRAC Bank.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nBBL UAT Team', 'This is a test message. Thank you from BRAC Bank. We want to continue to serve you and make your experience even better. Query No: {reference_no}', 'This is a test message. Thank you from BRAC Bank. We want to continue to serve you and make your experience even better.. Query No: {reference_no}', 'This is a test message.\r\nEscalation eMail has been generated for issue {form_request} and the Ticket No: {reference_no} and group name is {group_name}. Please have a look.\r\nRegards,\r\nBBL UAT Team', NULL, 1, 1, '::1', NULL, '2023-10-23 08:52:37');
